/-!
# Ch. III §5 (pp. 226–229): Definition 8, Remarks 1 and 2, and Lemma 14

The equivalent forms (ii)*, (ii)** of Definition 8 (p. 226), Remarks 1 and 2 (pp. 226–227), the coordinates
adapted to a residually rational monoidal transform, and Lemma 14 (pp. 227–229).

This is part 1 of 3 of `Hironaka.Ch3.PermissibleEffects`, which imports all parts; its description holds the
notation and the formalization notes for the whole section.
-/

@[expose] public section

